<title>POLAND: Krakchemia Q2 net rises to PLN 0.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Krakchemia Q2 net rises to PLN 0.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krakchemia preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     1.13   vs    0.98</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 0.94   vs    0.22</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.60   vs    0.20</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Krakchemia SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     36.74   vs   32.17</p>
<p>    costs of sales			30.06   vs   26.45</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.34   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.50   vs    0.04</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.70   vs    0.80</p>
<p>    investment			     6.06   vs    1.36</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		     2.20   vs    1.36</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 1.45   vs    0.08 loss</p>
<p>    net profit			     0.92   vs    0.10 loss</p>
<p>    net sales			     67.58   vs   58.61</p>
<p>    costs of sales			55.17   vs   48.10</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		 0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.53   vs    0.02</p>
<p>    other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.55   vs    0.05</p>
<p>    financial costs			1.30   vs    1.49</p>
<p>    investment			     6.91   vs    3.17</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
